# Copy to leak-patterns.local (gitignored) and list what is private to YOUR lab.
# tools/leak-scan blocks any of these from entering the repo. It already catches
# addresses, MACs, LAN host names, email addresses, push URLs and keys on its own.
#
# One term per line, matched case-insensitively as a whole word.
# Prefix with re: for a Python regular expression. Lines starting with # are comments.
#
# Machine names
server-name-1
# User names
your-login
# Domains, account IDs, SSIDs, people
your-domain
re:host-[0-9]+
